        {
          "id": 410179456,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "OK, I'll try resolving this thread and then just saying \"go for it\".  It'll still probably spend eternity in \"Checking pipeline status...\" hell, but we don't have to look at it again, and if that means GitLab's *servers* are burning resources, that's their problem, not ours.",
